<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN MINISTER CONFIRMS 1997 GDP TO GROW 2.1 PCT.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN MINISTER CONFIRMS 1997 GDP TO GROW 2.1 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Economic Affairs Elio di Rupo said in a statement on Monday that the National Accounts Institute has confirmed a Federal Planning Bureau forecast that the Belgian Gross Domestic Product (GDP) would grow by 2.1 in 1997 from 1.4 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
